ypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\mathcal M,T,\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(p,\\mathcal M,T,\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>-formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi)\\)</span> (free-variable set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (satisfaction relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10OmittedType}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel2OmittedType}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel5OmittedType}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10OmittedType}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel2OmittedType}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel5OmittedType}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}omitted\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10OmittedType}_S(p,\\mathcal M,T,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\land\\mathcal M\\models\\theta\\bigr)\\land p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\bigr)\\land\\Bigl[\\forall p_0\\in[p]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\mathcal N\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\Sigma)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;(\\mathcal N\\models\\theta)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p_0\\;(\\mathcal N\\models\\varphi[v_0\\mapsto a])\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in p\\;\\neg(\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi[v_0\\mapsto a])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}omitted\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10OmittedType}_S(p,\\mathcal M,T,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\land\\mathcal M\\models\\theta\\bigr)\\land p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\bigr)\\land\\Bigl[\\forall p_0\\in[p]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\mathcal N\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\Sigma)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;(\\mathcal N\\models\\theta)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p_0\\;(\\mathcal N\\models\\varphi[v_0\\mapsto a])\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in p\\;\\neg(\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi[v_0\\mapsto a])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\